settings-general-general-card = General
settings-general-monitor-label = Picker monitor
settings-general-monitor-desc = Choose a display, or use whichever monitor is focused when the picker opens. Close and reopen the picker after changing this.
settings-general-monitor-focused = Focused monitor
settings-general-monitor-unavailable = { $output } (unavailable)
settings-general-ui-scale-label = UI scale
settings-general-ui-scale-desc = Scale the entire picker interface. The range is 0.5 to 2.0.
settings-general-features-card = Features
settings-general-features-card-desc = Turn optional integrations on or off. Each enabled integration keeps its detailed settings in its own tab.
settings-general-feature-matugen-label = Matugen
settings-general-feature-matugen-desc = Use Matugen for wallpaper colours. Turning this off uses built-in Iris.
settings-general-feature-steam-label = Steam Workshop browser
settings-general-feature-steam-desc = Browse and install Wallpaper Engine items from Steam Workshop.
settings-general-feature-wallhaven-label = Wallhaven browser
settings-general-feature-wallhaven-desc = Browse and download wallpapers from wallhaven.cc.
settings-general-audio-card = Audio
settings-general-audio-card-desc = Set the default audio used by video and Wallpaper Engine wallpapers.
settings-general-mute-label = Mute wallpaper audio
settings-general-mute-desc = Silence video and Wallpaper Engine audio output.
settings-general-volume-label = Wallpaper volume
settings-general-volume-desc = Playback volume for video and Wallpaper Engine audio (0-100). Has no effect while audio is muted.
settings-general-other-audio-label = Pause wallpaper audio while other apps play sound
settings-general-other-audio-desc = Silence video and Wallpaper Engine audio whenever another application is playing sound, and bring it back about a second after it stops. Needs PipeWire or PulseAudio with the pactl command. Mute and volume settings stay as they are.
settings-general-other-audio-ducked = Wallpaper audio paused: another application is playing sound
settings-general-other-audio-listening = Listening for sound from other applications
settings-general-other-audio-unavailable = Sound server detection unavailable. Check that pactl is installed and PipeWire or PulseAudio is running.
settings-general-auto-recolour-card = Auto-recolour
settings-general-auto-recolour-card-desc = Create a palette-recoloured copy whenever a new wallpaper is added. The original file is kept unchanged.
settings-general-auto-recolour-label = Auto-recolour new wallpapers
settings-general-auto-recolour-desc = Save a recoloured copy beside every new wallpaper. Turn this off if you only want the original file.
settings-general-recolour-theme-label = Recolour theme
settings-general-recolour-theme-desc = Palette used when auto-recolouring new wallpapers.
settings-general-behaviour-card = Behaviour
settings-general-close-on-selection-label = Close on selection
settings-general-close-on-selection-desc = Hide the selector immediately after applying a wallpaper.
settings-general-hover-selects-label = Select on hover
settings-general-hover-selects-desc = Move the selection to the card under the pointer. Turn off to select with clicks and keys only.
settings-general-notify-label = Notify on wallpaper change
settings-general-notify-desc = Send a system notification each time the wallpaper changes.
settings-general-restore-label = Restore wallpaper on startup
settings-general-restore-desc = Re-apply the last wallpaper when the daemon starts.
settings-general-random-card = Random rotation
settings-general-rotate-label = Rotate automatically
settings-general-rotate-desc = Apply a random wallpaper from the pool below whenever the interval expires. The interval does nothing while this is off.
settings-general-interval-label = Interval
settings-general-interval-desc = Seconds between random rotations (minimum 10).
settings-general-include-images-label = Include images
settings-general-include-images-desc = Allow static wallpapers in the random pool.
settings-general-include-video-label = Include video
settings-general-include-video-desc = Allow video wallpapers in the random pool.
settings-general-include-we-label = Include Wallpaper Engine
settings-general-include-we-desc = Allow Wallpaper Engine items in the random pool.
settings-general-favourites-only-label = Favourites only
settings-general-favourites-only-desc = Restrict the random pool to favourited wallpapers.

settings-general-apply-picker-monitor-label = Apply only on the picker monitor
settings-general-apply-picker-monitor-desc = Apply wallpapers to the monitor where this picker opened. Choose displays can still target other monitors.
status-picker-monitor-unavailable = The picker monitor is unavailable. Reopen the picker or use Choose displays.
settings-configuration-transfer-card = Configuration transfer
settings-configuration-transfer-card-desc = Move your portable appearance settings between Skwd installations. Secrets, local paths, display names, and hardware choices stay on this device.
settings-configuration-export-label = Export settings
settings-configuration-export-desc = Save a versioned settings pack. The pack records the settings understood today so future versions can preserve new settings and ignore removed ones.
settings-configuration-export-action = Export
settings-configuration-import-label = Import settings
settings-configuration-import-desc = Merge a settings pack into this installation. Settings that are not in the pack are kept.
settings-configuration-import-action = Import
settings-configuration-export-dialog = Export Skwd settings
settings-configuration-import-dialog = Import Skwd settings
settings-configuration-export-complete = Settings exported to { $path }
settings-configuration-export-error = Could not export settings: { $error }
settings-configuration-import-complete = Settings imported from { $path }
settings-configuration-import-error = Could not import settings: { $error }
